How to run it
bash
# terminal 1 — your service
uvicorn app.main:app --host 0.0.0.0 --port 8000

# terminal 2 — the harness
python3 gridwise_test.py --url http://localhost:8000 \
    --cases public_sample_cases.json edge_cases.json

Useful variants:

bash
# just the official 10
python3 gridwise_test.py --url http://localhost:8000 --cases public_sample_cases.json

# one failing case, keep the raw response
python3 gridwise_test.py --url http://localhost:8000 --cases edge_cases.json --only EDGE-22 --save out/

# hunt LLM nondeterminism
python3 gridwise_test.py --url http://localhost:8000 --cases public_sample_cases.json --repeat 3

# final run against the deployed URL, from a different network
python3 gridwise_test.py --url https://your-app.example.com \
    --cases public_sample_cases.json edge_cases.json --report final.json --no-color
